# ---------------------------------------------------------------- secrets
# Per-machine SMBIOS identity.  Never commit: a shared serial/MLB causes
# Apple-side collisions that break iMessage/FaceTime on BOTH machines.
build/gen/smbios.local.py
# SSH host/user for the target laptop.
bin/rz.env.local

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- user data
# 3.7 GB image of the user's USB stick, including personal credential files.
backup/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- 3rd-party binaries
# Official acidanthera / USBToolBox release archives and their extractions.
# Re-download from the upstream GitHub releases; see docs/install-runbook.md
# for the exact versions and SHA-256 hashes.
downloads/
download/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- build output
# Assembled EFI trees (~2.2 GB across variants).  Reproducible from
# build/gen/mkconfig.py + build/ACPI-src/ + upstream kexts.
build/EFI/
build/EFI-*/
build/usb/
build/unused-kexts/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- misc
.DS_Store
._*
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Orphaned fragment of a third-party kext bundle (IntelBluetoothInjector).
unused-kexts/
